# Exclude build artefacts and IDE/OS junk from Docker build context.
# Maven needs the full module list to validate the parent POM's <modules>,
# so service Dockerfiles COPY . . (all 13 modules) — we just keep the
# context small by excluding everything that's regenerated.
**/target/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
**/*.iml
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
